# API reference (`/api/v1`)

Machine-readable spec: [`openapi.yaml`](./openapi.yaml).

## Conventions

- Base path: `/api/v1` on the same origin as the dashboard.
- Every response uses one envelope:
  - success: `{ "ok": true, "data": … }`
  - failure: `{ "ok": false, "error": { "code": "VALIDATION_FAILED", "message": "…", "details": { … } } }`
- Error codes: `BAD_REQUEST`, `VALIDATION_FAILED` (422), `UNAUTHORIZED` (401), `FORBIDDEN` (403),
  `NOT_FOUND` (404), `CONFLICT` (409), `GONE` (410), `RATE_LIMITED` (429), `CONFIG_ERROR`,
  `INTEGRATION_ERROR`, `AI_ERROR`, `SHEETS_ERROR`, `EMAIL_ERROR`, `LINKEDIN_ERROR`, `DATABASE_ERROR`, `INTERNAL`.
- Auth: `Authorization: Bearer <supabase access token>` for every `/api/v1` route except
  `health`, `auth/*`, `public/approvals/*` and the cron endpoint (which uses `x-cron-secret`).
- All times are ISO-8601 UTC; dates are `YYYY-MM-DD` in the owner's timezone.
- `Cache-Control: no-store` on all API responses.

## Public

| Method | Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| GET | `/health` | Liveness + config/database sanity (no secrets) |
| GET | `/auth/mode` | Whether the dashboard needs sign-in, dev-bypass state |
| POST | `/auth/login` | `{ email, password }` → owner session (rate limited, owner email only) |
| POST | `/auth/refresh` | `{ refreshToken }` → new session |
| GET | `/public/approvals/:token` | Renders the approval page: `actionable \| expired \| used \| invalid` |
| POST | `/public/approvals/:token/decision` | `{ action: "approve" \| "reject", note? }` — single use |

```bash
curl -s https://host/api/v1/health | jq
curl -s -X POST https://host/api/v1/public/approvals/$TOKEN/decision \
  -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{"action":"approve"}'
```

## Overview

| Method | Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| GET | `/overview` | Stats, schedule, integration status, latest posts, recent logs, mode |

## Content

| Method | Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| GET | `/content/topics?status=&from=&to=&limit=` | Topic queue |
| POST | `/content/topics` | Add a topic `{ topicDate, topic, contentType?, keyPoints?, targetAudience? }` |
| PATCH | `/content/topics/:id` | `{ status: "pending" \| "skipped" }` (reset a failed topic) |
| POST | `/content/topics/:id/retry` | Reset to pending |
| GET | `/content/posts?status=&from=&to=&limit=&offset=` | Generated posts |
| GET | `/content/posts/:id` | Post + topic + active approval + publishing job |
| PATCH | `/content/posts/:id` | `{ fullText }` — re-splits hook/body/hashtags, revalidates, marks edited |
| POST | `/content/sync` | Import eligible rows from Google Sheets |
| POST | `/content/generate` | `{ runDate?, sendEmail?, skipSync? }` — run the pipeline now |
| GET | `/content/stats` | Counts by status |

```bash
curl -s -X POST https://host/api/v1/content/generate -H "Authorization: Bearer $JWT" \
  -H 'content-type: application/json' -d '{}' | jq '.data.result.status'
```

## Schedule

| Method | Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| GET | `/schedule` | Local time, due-now reason, today's slot, next slot, scheduler state, queued/due jobs |
| POST | `/schedule/run` | `{ force?, runDate? }` — run one automation tick now |
| POST | `/schedule/cron` | Cron entry point; header `x-cron-secret: <CRON_SECRET>` |

## Approvals

| Method | Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| GET | `/approvals?status=pending&limit=` | Approvals joined with their posts |
| POST | `/approvals/:postId/decision` | `{ action: "approve" \| "reject", note? }` from the dashboard |
| POST | `/approvals/:postId/resend` | Rotate the token and re-send the email |

`decide` returns `{ action, post, approval, publish: { status, jobId, url, message }, sheetUpdated }` where
`publish.status` is `published | queued | manual_required | retry_scheduled | failed | already_published |
not_applicable`.

## Publishing

| Method | Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| GET | `/publishing/jobs?status=&limit=` | Job queue with posts |
| GET | `/publishing/history` | Published posts with LinkedIn URLs |
| POST | `/publishing/posts/:postId/publish` | Publish an approved post now (idempotent) |
| POST | `/publishing/posts/:postId/retry` | Requeue a failed post |
| POST | `/publishing/posts/:postId/manual` | `{ url }` — record a manual publish (LinkedIn URL validated) |

## Integrations

| Method | Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| GET | `/integrations` | Status of Sheets, LinkedIn, email, AI (no token values) |
| GET | `/integrations/:provider/authorize` | `{ url }` OAuth start (`google_sheets` \| `linkedin`) |
| GET | `/integrations/:provider/callback` | OAuth callback (state-verified, redirects to settings) |
| POST | `/integrations/google-sheets/config` | `{ sheetId \| sheetUrl, sheetTab? }` |
| POST | `/integrations/:provider/test` | Live check for `google_sheets`, `linkedin`, `resend`, `gemini` |
| DELETE | `/integrations/:provider` | Clear stored credentials |
| GET | `/integrations/dev/outbox` | **local mode only** — captured emails |

## Settings

| Method | Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| GET | `/settings` | Settings, AI provider/model, mode, owner email, base URL |
| PATCH | `/settings` | Partial update with validation (timezone, `HH:MM` times, days, TTL, voice, rules, hash range, max chars) |
| GET | `/settings/schedule` | Schedule overview (same shape as `/schedule`) |
| GET | `/settings/health` | Integration health summary |

## Logs

| Method | Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| GET | `/logs?level=&event=&limit=` | Execution log (redacted context) |
